  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A CORE CONTRIBUTION TO SUPPORT JLAC&#x2019;S 2023 WORK PLAN AND BUDGET FOR THEIR ACTIVITIES IN THE OCCUPIED PALESTINIAN TERRITORY (OPT).</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Jerusalem Legal Aid and Human Rights Centre (JLAC) addresses crucial issues affecting Palestinians with an important focus on East Jerusalem. As well as their work in monitoring and taking cases for Palestinians affected by house demolitions, movement and access issues, and the construction of the separation barrier, JLAC also carefully monitors human rights violations by the PA authorities.</narrative>
  </description>
